			"notes": "Hotfix for v0.1.0.\n\n## Fix\n- Server-startup crash: `NoFormatFoundException: No suitable format for dmcl.toml`. The shaded night-config relocation broke its SPI-based format discovery. Now passing `TomlFormat.instance()` explicitly to `FileConfig.of(path, format)` so the loader doesn't depend on `META-INF/services` files surviving relocation.\n\n## Compatibility unchanged\nMinecraft 1.21.1, 1.21.2, 1.21.3 with Fabric Loader >= 0.16.0 and Fabric API.\n\nIf you installed v0.1.0, delete that jar and drop in this one."
		},
