			"notes": "First public build of DMCL, the Minecraft 1.21.1 Fabric to Discord chat bridge.\n\n## What works in this build\n- Webhook per player Minecraft to Discord\n- Discord to Minecraft with markdown, mentions (sound + highlight when linked), replies, edits, deletes, custom emoji, attachments as clickable hover text\n- Account linking via /link in MC + /link <code> in Discord\n- Server events (joins, leaves, deaths, advancements, lifecycle) as colored embeds\n- Configurable per scope channel mapping in TOML\n\n## Install\nDrop the jar into your mods folder alongside Fabric API, start once, edit the generated config/dmcl.toml, set DMCL_DISCORD_TOKEN, restart.\n\nSee README for full setup details."
		}
